p/milestones/7","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/milestone/7","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/milestones/7/labels","id":453043,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNDUzMDQz","number":7,"title":"3.0.0","description":"New major release that breaks compatibility with 2.x\r\n\r\n- PHP5.4.19+\r\n- New ORM & behaviors.\r\n- Improved Routing\r\n- PSR-0 and composer support.\r\n- Simpler configuration and bootstrapping.\r\n- Improved configuration handling.\r\n- Improved bake.\r\n\r\nSee [the roadmap](http://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/wiki/3.0-roadmap) for more details.","creator":null,"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":2464,"state":"closed","created_at":"2013-10-11T20:56:23Z","updated_at":"2015-12-17T03:00:48Z","due_on":"2015-03-22T04:00:00Z","closed_at":"2015-03-23T01:02:41Z"},"comments":6,"created_at":"2014-08-11T10:43:34Z","updated_at":"2014-09-19T14:08:28Z","closed_at":"2014-08-12T06:57:50Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I am having trouble adding additional relations to a model without the _ids method.\nHere is an example of a data array and the results I get from the patch method.\n\n```\n[\n    'relations' => [\n        [\n            'id'=>1,\n            'title'=>'first'\n        ],\n        [\n            'id'=>2,\n            'title'=>'second updated'\n        ],\n        [\n            'title'=>'new entry'\n        ],\n        [\n            'id'=>3,\n            'title'=>'existing but not associated yet'\n        ]\n    ]\n];\n```\n\nThe first two ids would correctly save since they are already associated to the primary model.\nThe third would create a new entity as expected.\nThe problem is with ID 3.\nSince id 3 is not related to the primary model yet the ID gets discarded by the marshaller and a new entity is created even though the ID exists in the relations table.\nIs this a bug? Shouldn't ID:3 be respected and updated in this case instead of discarding it?\n","closed_by":{"login":"lorenzo","id":37621,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37621?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo","html_url":"https://github.com/lorenzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/4228/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/4228/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}